      "message": "DefaultYangParserFactory() resolves the XPath parser and the IR/YIN source transformers through ServiceLoader, and yang-parser-rfc7950 declares those implementations only as test dependencies, so they aren\u0027t pulled in transitively. In Karaf, the odl-yangtools-parser feature provides them. For          \nstandalone use, yangtools provides dagger-yang-parser, which brings them in at compile scope; we can switch to that instead of declaring them ourselves.\n\nWe do not have any examples of other projects because gnmi-device-simulator does not run using karaf.",
